  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "需要求解的线性方程组，它的变量的系数常常都不等于零。\n这就要求将方程组变形，至少使其中一个方程的某个变量的系数等于零，也就是化成上面讨论过的那种类型。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 132,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0138#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "需要求解的线性方程组，它的变量的系数常常都不等于零。这就要求将方程组变形，至少使其中一个方程的某个变量的系数等于零，也就是化成上面讨论过的那种类型。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来介绍解二元线性方程组的一种基本方法——加减消元法。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 132,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0138#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们来介绍解二元线性方程组的一种基本方法——加减消元法。",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设已知方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\qquad(1)\\\\x-y=6.\\qquad(2)\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 132,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0138#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "设已知方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\qquad(1)\\\\x-y=6.\\qquad(2)\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把已知方程左右两边分别相加，得到一个新方程：\n$3x+2y=13$。\n(3)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "把已知方程左右两边分别相加，得到一个新方程：$3x+2y=13$。　　(3)",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "作方程（1）和（2）的图象，作出的两条直线相交于点 $A$ $(5,-1)$（图 104）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "作方程（1）和（2）的图象，作出的两条直线相交于点 $A$ $(5,-1)$（图 104）。",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-104",
      "label": "图 104",
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-105",
      "label": "图 105",
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
