    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "直线（3）是不是也经过点 $A(5,-1)$ 呢？\n为了回答这个问题，我们指出，当 $x=5$，$y=-1$ 时，方程（1）和（2）变成真等式。\n如果将两个等式左右两边分别相加，那么又得到一个真等式。\n\n因此，数对 $x=5$，$y=-1$ 不仅满足方程（1）和（2），也满足方程（3）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "直线（3）是不是也经过点 $A(5,-1)$ 呢？为了回答这个问题，我们指出，当 $x=5$，$y=-1$ 时，方程（1）和（2）变成真等式。如果将两个等式左右两边分别相加，那么又得到一个真等式。因此，数对 $x=5$，$y=-1$ 不仅满足方程（1）和（2），也满足方程（3）。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这就是说，直线（3）经过直线（1）和（2）的交点 $A$（图 105）。\n\n因为直线（3）不同任一已知直线重合，所以方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\\\x-y=6\\end{cases}$和方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\\\3x+2y=13\\end{cases}$ 或 $\\begin{cases}3x+2y=13,\\\\x-y=6\\end{cases}$有完全相同的解：\n$x=5$，\n\n$y=-1$（点 $A$ 的坐标）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#8",
        "p0140#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "这就是说，直线（3）经过直线（1）和（2）的交点 $A$（图 105）。因为直线（3）不同任一已知直线重合，所以方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\\\x-y=6\\end{cases}$和方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\\\3x+2y=13\\end{cases}$　　或　　$\\begin{cases}3x+2y=13,\\\\x-y=6\\end{cases}$有完全相同的解：$x=5$，$y=-1$（点 $A$ 的坐标）。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "上面的例子说明一条重要的性质，这条性质以后我们要用到。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "上面的例子说明一条重要的性质，这条性质以后我们要用到。",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果将线性方程组的两个方程相加而得到的方程代替原方程组中的一个方程，那么新方程组和原方程组有相同的解集合。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果将线性方程组的两个方程相加而得到的方程代替原方程组中的一个方程，那么新方程组和原方程组有相同的解集合。",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "下面我们将说明怎样利用这个性质来解线性方程组。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "下面我们将说明怎样利用这个性质来解线性方程组。",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 1. 解方程组：\n$\\begin{cases}2x+y=9,\\\\x-y=24.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 1. 解方程组：$\\begin{cases}2x+y=9,\\\\x-y=24.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将已知方程左右两边分别相加，得到一个新的方程，用这个方程代替原方程组的一个方程：\n$\\begin{cases}3x=33,\\\\x-y=24.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "将已知方程左右两边分别相加，得到一个新的方程，用这个方程代替原方程组的一个方程：$\\begin{cases}3x=33,\\\\x-y=24.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从所得方程组的第一个方程求得：\n$x=11$。\n将求得的 $x$值代入第二个方程，得 $y=-13$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "从所得方程组的第一个方程求得：$x=11$。将求得的 $x$值代入第二个方程，得 $y=-13$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：\n$\\{(11,-13)\\}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "答：$\\{(11,-13)\\}$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2. 解方程组：\n$\\begin{cases}5x+11y=8,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 2. 解方程组：$\\begin{cases}5x+11y=8,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果将这两个方程左右两边分别相加，结果并没有化简，因为一个变量也没有消去。\n但是，如果事先把第一个方程的各项都乘以 $-2$，而第二个方程不变，那么两个方程中 $x$ 的系数是相反数：\n$\\begin{cases}-10x-22y=-16,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#10",
        "p0141#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果将这两个方程左右两边分别相加，结果并没有化简，因为一个变量也没有消去。但是，如果事先把第一个方程的各项都乘以 $2$，而第二个方程不变，那么两个方程中 $x$ 的系数是相反数：$\\begin{cases}-10x-22y=-16,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "math-correction"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在将两个方程相加，得到方程 $-29y=58$，其中 $x$ 的系数等于零。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "现在将两个方程相加，得到方程 $-29y=58$，其中 $x$ 的系数等于零。",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "用方程 $-29y=58$ 代替原方程组的第一个方程，得到新方程组：\n$\\begin{cases}-29y=58,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "用方程 $-29y=58$ 代替原方程组的第一个方程，得到新方程组：$\\begin{cases}-29y=58,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从方程 $-29y=58$ 得到：\n$y=-2$。\n将 $y=-2$ 代入第二个方程，解得 $x=6$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "从方程 $-29y=58$ 得到：$y=-2$。将 $y=-2$ 代入第二个方程，解得 $x=6$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：\n$\\{(6,-2)\\}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "答：$\\{(6,-2)\\}$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 3. 解方程组：\n$\\begin{cases}9x+7y=7,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "例 3. 解方程组：$\\begin{cases}9x+7y=7,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将第一个方程各项乘以 $3$，第二个方程各项乘以 $7$：\n$\\begin{cases}27x+21y=21,\\\\14x-21y=-595.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "将第一个方程各项乘以 $3$，第二个方程各项乘以 $7$：$\\begin{cases}27x+21y=21,\\\\14x-21y=-595.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将两个方程相加，得$\\begin{cases}41x=-574,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "将两个方程相加，得$\\begin{cases}41x=-574,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由此得：\n$\\begin{cases}x=-14,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "由此得：$\\begin{cases}x=-14,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从后一个方程组求得：\n$y=19$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "从后一个方程组求得：$y=19$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：\n$\\{(-14,19)\\}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
